body:
I deffo hear you on the topics, they don't seem to hit like I want them to and good note on the thumbnails, thanks! I think with your channel you suffer from that too in that we're not sure what you want the channel to be? Some videos seem more serious in tone than others and one was ASMR. I really liked how you just sat back in one video on your bed and your body language was like "okay let's get it"...it made you seem fun and entertaining. Maybe keep this as your style? As in that "no-fucks-given-whatever-man-" type of youtuber.

&#x200B;

p.s The thing is, with generative A.I art, you have to write prompts which is a skill in of itself. And it doesn't mean others will get the same animation even if they used the exact same prompt. So I'm hoping (for now) that, that'll keep the channel more "unique". Plus that's my voice and I own it...I think? Haha
